g\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/36/1iu35qaq0464p3zjy08of31gjx3o7gv.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E7%9B%97%E7%84%B0%E6%B7%AC%E7%BF%BC.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/36/1iu35qaq0464p3zjy08of31gjx3o7gv.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />盗焰淬翼\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">1级效果</span>]，魔攻提高<font color=\"#d68fe2\">9%</font>。行动开始时，获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">淬翼</font></span>]，回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点能量。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增减时，所增减的值转为同等层数的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">淬翼</span>]。<br />✦场上存在任意[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"戒律\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">戒律</font></span></span>]时，若[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">淬翼</span>]大于等于<font color=\"#ed7950\">50</font>层，则暴击率、暴击伤害、伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">2级效果</span>]，魔攻提高<font color=\"#d68fe2\">12%</font>。行动开始时，获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">淬翼</font></span>]，回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点能量。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增减时，所增减的值转为同等层数的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">淬翼</span>]。<br />✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">淬翼</span>]时，所有技能最大射程增加<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格。<br />✦场上存在任意[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"戒律\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">戒律</font></span></span>]时，若[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">淬翼</span>]大于等于<font color=\"#ed7950\">50</font>层，则暴击率、暴击伤害、伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">25%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">3级效果</span>]，魔攻提高<font color=\"#d68fe2\">15%</font>。行动开始时，获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">5</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">淬翼</font></span>]，回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点能量。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增减时，所增减的值转为同等层数的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">淬翼</span>]。<br />✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">淬翼</span>]时，所有技能最大射程增加<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格，魔攻额外提高<font color=\"#d68fe2\">15%</font>。<br />✦场上存在任意[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"戒律\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">戒律</font></span></span>]时，若[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">淬翼</span>]大于等于<font color=\"#ed7950\">50</font>层，则暴击率、暴击伤害、伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">\n<p>一级：20<img alt=\"信仰之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cf/jx6mev9riesiu122xg51bhx9q2zt5qx.png/40px-%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cf/jx6mev9riesiu122xg51bhx9q2zt5qx.png/60px-%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cf/jx6mev9riesiu122xg51bhx9q2zt5qx.png/80px-%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /